Index":0,"next":[{"move":"h4g4","comment":"黑方平车吃兵是正着。如改走车八退一则兵7进1，卒七进，兵7进1，红方先手。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"红方平炮串打马炮,力争主动。改走马6进5则马七进五，马4 进5马三进五,炮5进4车八平三,交换之后黑方多卒占优。黑方进 马采用先弃后取的手段与红方针锋相对,着法含蓄有力,甚见功夫。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f8","comment":"如改走车4平2黑方有两种走法;(一)炮二平四车8进9，马三退二马4进6，红先。(二) 马八进六马6进4,车八退二马4进2,红先。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4h3","comment":"第20回合红方贪功心切，避兑主力，退车保炮授人以隐，造成丢兵失势，局面转入下风。应改走炮8退4逼兑车炮，可造成马炮兵对双马卒的均势残局，红方稍好易成和局。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i3","comment":"如图形势:红方相位不正少兵，黑方阵形严正，车占要路又多卒，形势显然对黑方有利。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8c8","comment":"平炮瞄兵牵制红方七路，着法精细","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i3","comment":"第26回合红方退炮生根旨在冲七兵兑炮，但这一企图被 黑车平七所打破，不如径走马8进4则象七